    "body": "I'm not sure what part of the discussion led you to think that. The last point at which I had shown my agreement was to https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4876#issuecomment-529003304, which stated, amount other things, that:\r\n * Setting the inputmode to none on the currently focused element will set the \"is virtual keyboard showing\" boolean to false. (No user activation required)\r\n * Setting the inputmode away from none on the currently focused element will set the \"is virtual keyboard showing\" boolean to true, only with user activation.\r\n * The user agent/user may change the \"is virtual keyboard showing\" boolean in other ways as desired, e.g. the user can use the UI to hide the keyboard",
    "created_at": "2020-02-13T00:17:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-02-13T00:17:47Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5264#discussion_r378586667",
